111117-+The native patch is diagnostically better as well as identity-safe:
111118:+[`NtSetInformationFile`](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-hardware/drivers/ddi/ntifs/nf-ntifs-ntsetinformationfile)
111119-+returns the raw status, takes an `IO_STATUS_BLOCK`, documents class 10 and its
111120-+`DELETE` requirement, and explicitly instructs user-mode callers to use the
111121:+`NtSetInformationFile` name.
