120913-+
120914-+Microsoft defines [`ERROR_INVALID_PARAMETER` as 87](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/debug/system-error-codes--0-499-).
120915:+[`RtlNtStatusToDosError`](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/winternl/nf-winternl-rtlntstatustodoserror)
120916-+maps NTSTATUS to a Win32 system error and explicitly documents that there is no
120917-+inverse function. Therefore the Win32 result cannot prove whether the wrapper
120918-+rejected the record before a syscall or translated one of multiple native
--
120928-+does not itself explain these runs.
