120931:+[`NtSetInformationFile`](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-hardware/drivers/ddi/ntifs/nf-ntifs-ntsetinformationfile)
120932-+returns the raw status, takes an `IO_STATUS_BLOCK`, documents class 10 and its
120933-+`DELETE` requirement, and explicitly instructs user-mode callers to use the
120934:+`NtSetInformationFile` name.
